cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "MLEpiVet-ScR: data processing and visualization pipeline for a scoping review of machine learning in notifiable animal disease epidemiology"
abstract: >-
  Analysis code for the PRISMA-ScR scoping review "Application of Machine
  Learning Methods in the Epidemiology of Notifiable Animal Diseases":
  data standardization, algorithm/disease/country classification, and
  publication-ready figure generation covering eight WOAH-notifiable
  diseases (ASF, FMD, HPAI, BTV, CSF, ND, LSD, WNV).
authors:
